OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with lengthy clear spells for
OL,7,Fmost places. Remaining dry through the
OL,8,Frest of the night with lighter winds,
OL,9,Fbut still rather breezy on coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA dry day with lengthy sunny
OL,12,Fspells, especially across northern and
OL,13,Feastern Aberdeenshire. More in the way
OL,14,Fof cloud for Upper Deeside but still
OL,15,Fremaining dry.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,18,Fchangeable with showers or longer
OL,19,Fspells of rain on Friday, but
OL,20,Fgenerally drier on the weekend with
OL,21,Fbright spells.
